>> Bard patch 0.3 for Nethack 3.4.3
>>
>> This version is a complete rewrite of the previous one; I abandoned 
>> the idea of using different versions of known spells as songs.
>>
>> This patch basicly adds two things:
>> - Bards as a new class
>> - The 'music' skill
>>
>> Races/roles with the music skill can use musical instruments to play 
>> songs which have magical effects (e.g. 
>> peace/sleep/taming/fear/confusion/berserk pets/...)
>>
>> More details and a pre-compiled Windows version at the page:
>> http://bertelli.endofinternet.net/computers/games/nethack/bard.html
>>
